Key Takeaway

ARM templates provide a powerful Infrastructure as Code solution for deploying Azure resources consistently and efficiently. By using declarative JSON templates with parameters and outputs, Azure Administrators can automate deployments, maintain version control, and support scalable cloud infrastructure management across multiple environments.
